# Capability assistance remains a read-only contract sketch.
# Canonical usage discovery and provenance validation live in gooo-jev.

module usage_assistance

input declaration_source
input prefix
input capability_id
input capability_state
input next_operation
input source_digest
input discovery_digest
input plan_digest
input assistance_digest

status AVAILABLE a capability is bound and can be described
status DEFERRED a capability remains evidence-bound and cannot be claimed yet
status UNKNOWN the declaration boundary is not sufficient for a capability claim

field capability_id
field capability_state
field next_operation
field source_digest
field discovery_digest
field plan_digest
field assistance_digest

constraint observation_only
constraint non_executing
constraint non_authorizing
constraint provenance_bound
constraint deferred_is_not_success
constraint deferred_is_not_failure
